BT /F2 14 Tf 0.29 0.87 0.5 rg 54 620 Td (1. What it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 599.7 Td (DeliveryBuddy MK2 is a single-file, installable web app \(PWA\) that tells you whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 585.2 Td (a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 565.7 Td (delivery offer is worth taking. You enter the payout, miles, and number of stops; it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 546.2 Td (grades the offer against your target $/hr after fuel and deadhead \(empty miles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 531.7 Td (back\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 512.2 Td (Everything runs on your phone. There is no account, no server, and no data leaves) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 497.7 Td (the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 478.2 Td (device - all history is stored locally in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 452.7 Td (It is a profit ANALYZER only. It does not auto-accept offers or automate the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 438.2 Td (delivery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 418.7 Td (apps in any way.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.29 0.87 0.5 rg 54 385.2 Td (2. What you need) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 364.9 Td (* An Android phone \(built and tested on a Pixel 9\) with Chrome, or any modern) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 350.4 Td (  browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 332.9 Td (* The app folder "deliverybuddymk2" containing: index.html, manifest.webmanifest,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 318.4 Td (  sw.js, and icon.svg.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 300.9 Td (* A way to serve the folder over https or localhost \(see Section 3\). Opening the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 286.4 Td (  file directly with file:// will show the app but WILL NOT install or accept) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 271.9 Td (  screenshots.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.29 0.87 0.5 rg 54 240.4 Td (3. Install on your phone) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 213.1 Td (Why hosting is required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 195.15 Td (Install + Share-to-app \(screenshot OCR\) only work over https or localhost. Pick ONE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 180.65 Td (of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 161.15 Td (the hosting options below, then do "Add to Home screen".) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 54 134.65 Td (Option A - GitHub Pages \(free, permanent link\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 116.7 Td (* Create a new GitHub repository and upload the four app files to the root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 99.2 Td (* In the repo: Settings > Pages > Build from branch > main > / \(root\) > Save.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 81.7 Td (* Wait ~1 minute; open the https://<you>.github.io/<repo>/ link on your phone.) Tj ET
endstream
