BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 452.1 Td (* Launch it from the new icon - it now runs full-screen like a native app and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.12 rg 70 437.6 Td (  works offline \(the service worker caches it\).) Tj ET
endstream
